          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 775070864}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
      setEmotes:
        emotions:
        - player: 0
          character: {fileID: 744502771}
          emotes: 0
          duration: 0
      questions:
        fromDatabase: 0
        questions:
          questions: []
        cycle: 1
        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 2
      interval: 0
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 744502771}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 0}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: Magandang araw, Bayani! Ngayon ay sisimulan natin ang Ikalima bahagi
            ng iyong paglalakbay sa El filibusterismo. Tatalakayin natin ang mahahalagang
            pangyayari mula Kabanata 31 hanggang 39
      setLocation:
        setLocatoins: []
      setEmotes:
        emotions: []
      questions:
        fromDatabase: 0
        questions:
          questions: []
        cycle: 1
        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 0
      interval: 0
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 744502771}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 0}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: Good day, class!
        - characterObj: {fileID: 744502771}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 0}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: "Today, we are going to talk about a very interesting and important
            topic \u2014 the thematic analysis of Chapters 1 to 5 of Noli Me Tangere.
            This lesson is important because it helps us understand not only the
            story, but also the social issues and historical realities that Rizal
            wanted to expose during his time"
      setLocation:
        setLocatoins:
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 875644703}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1997530391}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 775070864}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 775070864}
          direction: 2
          walk: 0
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
      setEmotes:
        emotions: []
      questions:
        fromDatabase: 0
        questions:
          questions: []
        cycle: 1
        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 1
      interval: 1
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 744502771}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 7096670327494543431, guid: 1189e97e912249f40a9ba9cf596f1aea, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: "Magandang araw Bayani, narito ka na sa huling antas ng iyong paglalakbay
            sa El Filibusterismo! Sa yugtong ito, masasaksihan natin ang pagtatapos
            ng kwento\u2014ang kabiguan ng rebolusyon ni Simoun, ang kanyang pagbabalik-loob,
            at ang aral na iniwan ni Rizal para sa mga susunod na henerasyon.Sa kabila
            ng kabiguan, nananatili ang pag-asa, at ang liwanag ng kabutihan ay patuloy
            na nagliliwanag sa puso ng bayan."
      setLocation:
        setLocatoins:
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 875644703}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1997530391}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 775070864}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
      setEmotes:
        emotions: []
      questions:
        fromDatabase: 0
        questions:
          questions: []
        cycle: 1
        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 0
      interval: 0
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 744502771}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 4146786208365501868, guid: 03f70a10334e1644f8f5a4eb19dded4c, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 1
          line: Sa huling sandali ni Simoun, tuluyan niyang inamin ang kanyang pagkakamali
            at pagkadismaya sa daan ng paghihiganti. Sa kanyang kamatayan, natutunan
            niya na ang tunay na pagbabago ay hindi makakamtan sa karahasan kundi
            sa kabutihan at pagmamahal sa bayan.
        - characterObj: {fileID: 744502771}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 1335385452945238478, guid: 159f63f6aa417fe41869a34e1c2c57a9, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 1
          line: Si Padre Florentino ay nagsilbing tinig ng pananampalataya at pag-asa.
            Sa kanyang mga salita, hinamon niya ang kabataan na ipagpatuloy ang laban,
            ngunit sa daang matuwid at marangal.
        - characterObj: {fileID: 744502771}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 4633355498211079068, guid: 41b2485834ffa4649a6d67dd4208bb3d, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 1
          line: "Ang huling mensahe ni Rizal ay malinaw\u2014ang kabataan ang tagapagmana
            ng kanyang adhikain. Sa pamamagitan ng edukasyon, kabutihan, at pagkakaisa,
            makakamit ang tunay na kalayaan"
      setLocation:
        setLocatoins:
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 875644703}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1997530391}
